window.products.push({"id":528023,"name":"Rachael Ray Accessories Kitchen Pantryware Multi Purpose/Salad Serveware/Melamine Garbage Bowl, Dark Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717LnlLRRnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cooking is fun. Cleaning up, while necessary, is not the most exciting part of being in the kitchen. But using a Garbage Bowl during prep can cut down on cleaning time and trips to the trash can. The Garbage Bowl is a convenient and stylish place to stash scraps that add up when chopping veggies, dicing chicken breasts or de-stemming strawberries. Plus, the fun speckle finish makes this bowl anything but boring. Rachael Ray Accessories make time in the kitchen efficient and fun. The Garbage Bowl is the perfect place to throw scraps and odds and ends while chopping, slicing and dicing, so you don't have to interrupt cooking to make trips to the trash can. The bowl's stylish speckle pattern means it can also double as a fruit bowl or a serving bowl. The rubberized base helps the Garbage Bowl stay right where you put it and it's top rack dishwasher safe so cleaning up is always a cinch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717LnlLRRnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rachael Ray","source_asin":"B008PRG6DK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-528023","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008PRG6DK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008PRG6DK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":528024,"name":"Poedist 5 Pcs Grey Bathroom Decor Set,Shower Curtain Sets with Rugs,Include Bath Towel,U Mat,Toilet Lid Cover & Bath Mat,with 12 Hooks,Creative Purple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817TQEMjKYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Great Value and Cute Bathroom Decor Set with Bath Towel】The beautiful and clear pattern bathroom shower curtain sets including waterproof shower curtain and 12 durable hooks,Combine with bathroom mat sets- bath mat,U shape and toilet seat cover mat,Match same pattern bath towel,Creating a cute and full of vitality bathroom atmosphere for you.It is an ideal surprise for your kids or loved one. 【Perfect Sizes for Your Bathroom Application】This bathroom combination decoration set suitable for most bathroom(restroom) environments. Perfect sizes as follow: Waterproof shower curtain: 72\"L X 72\"W, Bath Towel: 59\"L X 31\"W, Non-slip bath mat: 30\"L X 18\"W, U shape rug: 20\"L X 20\"W, O shape toilet lid cover mat: 18\"L X 16\"W. The plus size and thicker material enhancing the practicality and functionality for this nice set. 【Premium and Reliable Materials】High-quality waterproof fabric shower curtain configured rust-proof metal buckles, light-proof and easy to air dry. A drop line is added at the bottom of the shower curtain to increase the drape of the shower curtain. Bath towel is made from fabric which is highly absorbent and easy to wring out. The Non-slip and thickened mats give your feet a softer and more comfortable enjoyment, and the good water absorption function is enough to meet your bathing needs. 【Clear and Fade-Resistant Pattern】Thanks to good quality materials and advanced craftsmanship, this creative cute and nice pattern will always come out clearly on shower curtain and bath towel and mats. Even after multiple dippings or prolonged using, it will remains the same and never fades, Always bathe you in a energetic and beautiful bathroom atmosphere. 【Tips for You】No.1-The fluorescent effect of the mobile phone or computer may cause a few color difference between the product picture and the actual product, which is a normal phenomenon, please forgive its existence. No.2- Due to the vacuum packaging, the mats has not returned to its original shape when the package is opened, please be patient for a few hours(4-6 hours).If the mats do not lay flat, soak and hang to dry them to solve the problem.Any questions please contact us anytime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817TQEMjKYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poedist","source_asin":"B0B3DFH8SS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-528024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3DFH8SS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3DFH8SS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":528025,"name":"Adorox 2pcs Watermelon knife Slicer Stainless Steel Server Corer Cutter for Watermelon Cantaloupe or Honeydrew,Sharper & Sturdy & Safe (2pcs)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AB+vdWvCL._AC_.jpg","description":"This comes with 2 pieces of Watermelon slicer. CLEAN & TIDY & SAFE- You can cut up a watermelon needn't touch it at all with your hands.Further more,to protect hands,the product are designed to be added on a PVC cover. EASY & ACCURATE- It's easy to operate. Help you cut watermelons into consistent size pieces.Even the novice chef can cut it beautiful and make a perfect salad. STURDY MATERIAL & CONVENIENT- Unlike the plastic Watermelon slicer or Mellon ballers,we use stainless steel material so the slicers are sturdy,easily cleaned and help you cut up the whole watermelon in minutes. MULTIPURPOSE- Not only for the WATERMELON, you can also use for CANTALOUPE and HONEYDEW. Enjoy various fruits! PROTECT YOURSELF FROM CUTS and INJURIES. Stop using knives and other sharp kitchen tools in order to cut your watermelon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AB+vdWvCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adorox","source_asin":"B073SJGMX2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-528025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073SJGMX2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073SJGMX2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
