window.products.push({"id":528342,"name":"Home Brewing Glass Beer Bottle with Easy Wire Swing Cap & Airtight Rubber Seal Amber - 16oz - Case of 6 - by Tiabo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716x4oa7hIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether home brewing or hosting parties is your game, these Glass Beer Bottles with Easy Swing Caps by Tiabo are for you. They have a large 16 oz.(two cup) capacity and they have wire and rubber caps which easily seal to preserve the freshness of your beverage or brew. Create your own custom home brew creations with this clever jar. Enjoy beer, soda, kombucha, kefir, and more! Whether you are a seasoned brewer or looking to develop a new hobby, these glass bottles will prove to be an asset. Beer lovers can now reduce the environmental impact of their beer consumption by using these refillable and reusable glass bottles. Product Features: Reusable Amber Glass Bottles 16 oz. capacity Wire Swing Cap Airtight Rubber Seal  Pack of 6 These amber, longneck glass bottles fit into any decor and are appropriate for any occasion, formal or casual. Impress your friends with their elegance, or accessorize your dining table for Thanksgiving or Christmas dinner. Whether you are a novice or seasoned homebrewer, host or hostess, this package of 6 bottles will save you money! At a 16 oz. capacity per bottle, this pack holds a total of 96 oz! That’s plenty to serve at your next party! DESIGNED WITH YOU IN MIND Tiabo Glass Beer Bottles are safely packaged to prevent breakage during shipping. The glass bottles are reusable and dishwasher safe. Sturdy gaskets with steel wire assembly and rubber flip tops are easy to remove and put on, keeping your homecrafted beverages securely sealed and preserving carbonation and fermentation. Easy to use and easy to clean, these glass beer bottles are a win-win situation!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716x4oa7hIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiabo","source_asin":"B06ZZY6Z4G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-528342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06ZZY6Z4G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06ZZY6Z4G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
