window.products.push({"id":528473,"name":"Heartland Home Porcelain Sponge Holder for Kitchen Sink. Compact Sink Caddy Organizer - Scouring Pad and Dish Sponge Holder. Ceramic Black and White K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s1eybdXuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GIVE YOUR SPONGES A NICER HOME: Instead of a cup-shaped sponge dish, we’ve gone totally square! So you can fit more sponges, bigger sponges, or use them as a dual sponge and scouring pad sink scrubber holder! Not only that, it holds your sink stopper and lets you retrieve it easier than fishing in a cup. SIZED FOR YOUR SPONGES: This kitchen sponge holder is 3.5” wide, 3” tall, and 2.2” deep. It has a generously sized cut out; 1.2” at the base, and 1.4” at the top. So measure up your sponges and scouring pads now, see how well they fit, and then add this sink holder to your kitchen sink organization. 100% DISHWASHER SAFE: Made from high-grade porcelain this sponge tray is thick, strong, and Dishwasher Safe (up to 500DegF) to easily clean up food or fingerprints and keep it glossy and looking like new! CURATE A CLEAN, COORDINATED PORCELAIN KITCHEN! Did you know Heartland Home is home to dozens of Classic Porcelain Kitchen Items? And with the same heft and beauty you’d find amongst your grandma’s carefully stored belongings. Need a sponge holder and matching napkin holder? Check out our product line! GIFT BOXED: A thick weighted kitchen sink sponge holder with sharp lettering and beautifully gift boxed. This porcelain sponge rack is an easy choice for Housewarming Gifts, Christmas Presents, Birthday Gifts, or Wedding Gifts. Give your sponge a nicer home, with a white sponge holder from Heartland Home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s1eybdXuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heartland Home","source_asin":"B09ZTMHBW9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-528473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZTMHBW9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZTMHBW9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":528474,"name":"Luxury Premium Weight Goose Down Comforter, Double","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.01,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8192SvSF-1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This made in Canada comforter is filled with premium 100% white goose down, among the finest down in the world. What better place to create the perfect warm and cozy comforter than Canada, known for its frigid winters and hot summers? A little-understood fact about down: the higher the quality of the down, the less it weighs. That’s because the higher the quality of the down, the more air gets trapped between the clusters, and the higher the loft, which produces the temperature-regulating effect throughout the year, making this comforter perfect for all seasons. The 100% combed cotton sateen shell is a fine 400tc (thread count) down proof cover which keeps the down inside, and the baffle box construction ensures that the down stays evenly distributed. Their white goose down is treated with Allerton-21(r) ultra-fresh to remove any known allergens before the duvets are filled. You will enjoy an unrivaled sleep under this superb comforter. Sweet dreams.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8192SvSF-1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WESTEX","source_asin":"B08TY4YDVJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-528474","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TY4YDVJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TY4YDVJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
