window.products.push({"id":528587,"name":"RICETREES Dish Soap Bar, Handmade With Rice Flour Base - Ideal For Sensitive Skin - Sparkling Clean Dishes - Solid Bar Soap - Free of Artificial Color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S5RIKgjyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HANDMADE UNSCENTED DISH SOAP - These handmade dish soap blocks are a great way to get cleaner dishes without compromising your environmental footprint. These handmade products come in zero-waste packaging and only conain vegan friendly ingredients! MADE WITH SIMPLE INGREDIENTS - With these bar dish soap blocks what you see is what you get. They are made from simple locally sourced ingredients and is free from harsh chemicals. Each bar made only contains coconut oil, canola oil, sodium hydroxide, sodium bicarbonate, rice flour, cedarwood oil, distilled water COLD PROCESS SOAP MAKING METHOD - We believe in keeping it simple, so we use a USDA certified oil to complete the cold process soap making method while making these zero-waste dish soaps. There are also no artificial colors added! PLASTIC-FREE PACKAGING - We all want to do our part in protecting the environment, which is why our solid dish soap bar has been made for you. Made without any harsh chemicals and with reduced carbon footprint thanks to its packaging - wrapped up in kraft tissue paper instead of plastic! IDEAL FOR SENSITIVE SKIN - Our dish block soap is especially made for families wanting to go zero-waste. It only contains simple ingredients without any harsh chemicals. The Glycerin oil compound will help make your hands soft. The rice flour may soothe sensitive skin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S5RIKgjyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RICETREES","source_asin":"B0BN578GM3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-528587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN578GM3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN578GM3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
