window.products.push({"id":528598,"name":"Qiunizadila Oil Sprayer for Cooking, 100ml Portable Olive Oil Sprayer with Food Grade Nozzle for BBQ, Salad, Shala, Roasting, Grilling, Baking. (Silve","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OffHyT6tS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specification: Material: ABS + lead-free glass Size(approx): 1.6*7inch Color: Silver, Gold, Rose Gold（Choose one of three） Capacity: 100ml HOW TO USE: 1.Fill your oil sprayer bottle with your favorite oil. No overfill, better leave some space. 2.Put the cap back on.Aim the nozzle at the food and press the cap to deliver the most effective oil mist. 3.Hold the bottle vertically while spraying. Never tilt the bottle at an angle greater than 45 degrees while spraying. 4.You can refill and reuse with all your favorite oils, such a fine mist will no more waste oil. HOW TO CLEAN: 1. Fill bottle with hot water and add one drop of liquid detergent.Shake it 5-10 times, then spray into the sink. 2.Refill with clean water, repeat step 2 and wash inner side with a brush. 3.Re-tighten the cap and store at room temperature until next use. 4.It is recommended to clean your Cooking Oil Sprayer every 5-6 weeks. The Olive Oil Sprayers can be filled with oils, vinegar, soy sauce and lemon juice and other liquid. It is perfect for barbecue, cold plate, salad because of it small size and convenient design. With the glass bottle, you can recognize the category of the liquid and residual content. Press the valve on the pressurized sprayer produces a super-fine mist, more uniform in spraying and control the amount of oil per time used in cooking, which is healthier for you and your family too The oil chamber is made from Food-grade scratch-resistant glass, which is easy to clean, while the pump is cleverly hidden from view inside the stainless steel top. BPA-free and eco-friendly Handled and perfect size (Height 7inch x Diameter 1.6inch) can be used in kitchen cook tool or carried outside for BBQ ,Picnic, grilling etc. fill it with lemon juice and spritz a salmon steak or spray it on fruit to keep it fresh","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OffHyT6tS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qiunizadila","source_asin":"B092TS8HSJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-528598","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092TS8HSJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092TS8HSJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
