window.products.push({"id":528840,"name":"Centrifugal Juicer Machine Centrifugal Juice Extractor for Fruit and Vegetable Wide Chute 450W Easy to Clean with 2 Speed Modes, 75 dB Low Noise, Anti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ftJJdTAeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍹【High Juice Yield】This centrifugal juicer machine adopts corrosion-resistant food grade 304 stainless steel sharp blades and precision filter, having higher juice yield and creating purer juice with more nutrition. With a 3'' (65mm) wide feed chute, it can process whole fruits and vegetables in a few seconds, saving prep time. 🍹【Dual Speed Modes】Equipped with 450W motor, there are two speed modes to select. High speed for hard fruit and vegetables, such as pomegranates, pineapples, carrots, cucumbers, beets, kales, etc. Low speed for soft fruits and vegetables, like oranges, watermelons, grapes, strawberries, tomatoes, etc. 🍹【Safety Guarantee】Surface lid and locking bar can keep the cover of the juicer tightly closed while working. Only when the lid is locked properly will the electric juicer start to run. Overheat protection enables the small fruit juicer to automatically shut down if motor is overloaded. Made of BPA free material, you don't need to worry about health. 🍹【Easy to Clean】The centrifugal juice extractor is easy to disassemble and clean after each use. All the detachable parts can be conveniently washed under running water. And the filter can be cleaned easily with the included brush, making cleaning an easy job. 🍹【Perfect for Daily Use】This centrifugal juicer machine is suitable for juicing a variety of fruits and vegetables. You can easily enjoy fresh, nutritious and delicious juice every day. In addition, the juicer runs with noise lower than 75 dB, providing a comfortable juicing environmrnt. Perfect for daily use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ftJJdTAeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Clarfey","source_asin":"B0BNN5J51B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-528840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNN5J51B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNN5J51B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
