window.products.push({"id":528936,"name":"FZCBY Soft Shaggy Faux Fur Blanket Fluffy Fleece and Sherpa Bed Throw Decorative Sofa Throws Machine Washable Blankets for Sofa Bed Couch Chair, 60\"x8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mebuOEIcS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"<p><b>Soft and Lightweight:</b> This is just the right throw blanket if you are looking for something that makes your feel like being in a soft lightweight cloud. It is a very nice sofa blanket for you to curl up with while sipping a cup of coffee, the warmth and coziness will immediately release you from fatigue and stress. <p><b>Unique Double Side Design:</b> To make this faux fur blanket both looking and feeling good, we specially designed its two sides with different texture-the outside is of plush long shags which looks quite luxurious and elegant and the inside is of Sherpa lining with really soft and warm touching. <p><b>High Quality Material:</b> A nice fluffy blanket requires high quality material. That's why we choose 100% microfiber to make these products. This material is more than just comfy and light, it is also eco-friendly, you can enjoy the feeling of fur-like blankets as well as protecting animals and environment. <p><b>Multiple Use:</b> You will be amazed by how many occasions this soft blanket will come into use -a throw blanket on the sofa/couch, an air conditioner blanket in summer, a blanket on your bed, a nursery blanket for the baby, a casual blanket in your car, a nap blanket in the office, or even a very stylish photo prop etc.. <p><b>Easy to Maintain:</b> We know how much you enjoy this comfy blanket and want to keep it clean as new. You just need to put the blanket into the washing machine, add mild detergent, choose the delicate cycle with cold water, and dry with air fluff mode on low temperature. Use a laundry bag for the first wash in case the blanket sheds a little.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mebuOEIcS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FZCBY","source_asin":"B09G62KCB5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-528936","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G62KCB5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G62KCB5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
