window.products.push({"id":528995,"name":"Seiko Clock (Model: QXH045BLH), One Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PB3setyRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description With its subtle mission-style design, this wall clock will make a stately addition to your traditional home. Finely crafted in a warm brown wood with a gold-tone pendulum, this wall clock features Westminster/Whittington quarter-hour chimes and hourly strikes, precise quartz movement, nighttime chime silencer, and volume control. Its cream dial features black details behind a crystal glass lens. Amazon.com A modern classic comes to life with Seiko's Wall Clock With Pendulum. This impressive clock is sure to please both the eyes and the ears with its rich wood case and melodious chimes that ring on the quarter hour. It looks like an antique that might have graced your grandmother's living room, but this beautiful timepiece features contemporary quartz movement. It also has volume control and a chime silencer for those times when you prefer some quiet. One C battery is included. The Seiko Story From Humble beginnings, Kintaro Hattoris Vision for Seiko has become reality. A consuming passion for excellence - imprinted in our Corporate DNA passed from generation to generation. Seiko, for 125 years committed to the art and science of time. A culture of innovation connects a 19th century Tokyo clock shop with 20th century advances in timekeeping to an extraordinary 21st century \"quiet revolution.\" Continually driven by dedication and passion, established a multitude of worlds first technologies transforming the principles of timekeeping. The first quartz wristwatch  changed the history of time. The first Kinetic  marked a new era in quartz watch technology. In 1969, Seiko Astron, the first quartz wristwatch - was introduced. In an instant, Seiko exponentially improved the accuracy of wristwatches And Seiko technology firmly established todays standard in Olympic and sports timing. 1984, another celebrated first  Kinetic Technology  powered by body movement. Kinetic  a quartz mechanism with unparalleled accuracy the driving force behind more worlds firsts. Kinetic Chronograph  the next generation of high performance timekeeping. Kinetic Auto Relay  automatically resets to the correct time. Kinetic Perpetual - combining the date perfect technology of perpetual calendar with the genius of Kinetic Auto Relay. And now Kinetic Direct Drive  move, and the watch is powered automatically. Or hand wind it and see the power you are generating in real time. In the realm of fine watches, time is measured by Seiko innovation  A heritage of dedication to the art and science of time. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PB3setyRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEIKO","source_asin":"B002WN2AE2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-528995","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002WN2AE2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002WN2AE2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
